# Corridor / feeder data rules

- Every milestone with crossBorder: true MUST include borderPrep (badge + checklist).
- legType === "transfer" OR "feeder" ⇒ estimate: true.
- Prices already in IDR (no runtime FX).
- Grab/taxi only as short transfer connectors, never long-haul.
- Route ids stable for share URLs: cheap-overland | faster-hybrid | scenic.
